"Write only EFI/AnduinOS, do not overwrite EFI/BOOT, and require a verified "
"AnduinOS NVRAM entry."
msgstr ""
"Tulis hanya EFI/AnduinOS, jangan timpa EFI/BOOT, dan memerlukan entri NVRAM "
"AnduinOS yang terverifikasi."

msgid "automatic login"
msgstr "login otomatis"

msgid "create a machine-local MOK; enroll after reboot with password 123456"
msgstr ""
"membuat MOK lokal mesin; daftarkan setelah reboot dengan kata sandi 123456"

